# Agent scratch. Both directories are working space for coding agents, both are
# untracked, and neither holds anything this project ships. .claude/worktrees/
# in particular is a full checkout of this repo per agent, so every file in it
# is a second copy of a file the scan already covers in its real location.
#
# They are ignored here rather than in procoder's built-in defaults on purpose:
# .claude/ is also where people keep hooks, statusline scripts and skill
# definitions they wrote by hand, and un-gating that for every user of the tool
# to tidy up one repo's audit would be the wrong trade.
.claude/
.superpowers/
